# openclipart downloads are one `pick <slug> <id>` away (manifest source_url) and some run
# to megabytes; only inputs that cannot be re-fetched are committed.
sources/*
!sources/Baseball_bat.svg
!sources/Football_gridiron.svg
!sources/Gerald_G_Baseball_2.svg
!sources/crossed-bats.svg
!sources/crossed-sticks.svg
